     "upstream_inference_prompt_cost": 0.000184662,
     "upstream_inference_completions_cost": 4.194e-05
    },
    "completion_tokens_details": {
     "reasoning_tokens": 0,
     "image_tokens": 0,
     "audio_tokens": 0
    }
   },
   "answered": true,
   "text": "Both triggers happen at the same time—at the beginning of the upkeep step. They are put onto the stack in APNAP (active player, then nonactive player) order. The active player (you) chooses the order of your own triggers, then the nonactive player (your opponent) chooses the order of theirs. This happens before any player gets priority during the upkeep step.",
